sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + decision agent-observer-swamp-acts; the key stays on the Node, R2.
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Target Node<br/>reached over ssh
  Note over GW: Operator starts recovery<br/>orbit:node-agent-rekey 12 5130
  Note over GW: Bind open converge #5130<br/>same Node, user, observer pin
  Note over GW: Record task, lock Node<br/>task #5134 · no secret in intent
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-node-agent-rekey
  SW->>N: Look up the Node account<br/>@swamp/ssh · getent passwd orbit
  SW->>N: Write a new observer key<br/>0600 file, never leaves the Node
  SW->>N: Restart the observer<br/>systemctl restart orbit-agent
  alt observer back up
    N-->>SW: verifier, SHA-256 only
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event · verifier_hash
    Note over GW: Store the new verifier<br/>agent_secret_hash · old key void
    N->>GW: Observer reports state<br/>new key · read-only, no actions
  else write or restart fails
    N--xSW: exit ≠ 0
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>operation.native_failed
    Note over GW: Keep the old verifier<br/>converge #5130 stays open
  end
